Ever tried "Oddyssey: The Compleat Apventure" [sic]? I used to play it on the
Apple II+. It does all of the above, in very simplistic terms. You start with a
small party of men, and you can keep on adding to your party. However, you also
had to keep them *all* fed and outfitted. I don't remember any use of spells,
but I do remember parties of wizards, so I think there must have been magic.
Lots of fun.
